{"content_hash": "b09ece5f35cd43d5", "version_id": 1033, "article_id": 104, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Apple changes leaders and launches a folding iPhone in 2026", "title_zh": "苹果2026年换帅又出折叠屏，这一年看点不少", "has_translation": true, "topic": "lifestyle", "source": "sspai", "source_url": "https://sspai.com/post/119191", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621768216002-5ac171876625?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8N3x8YXBwbGV8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc5NTIyODc3OHww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Sumudu Mohottige on Unsplash", "author": "Sumudu Mohottige", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@stm_2790?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/apple-logo-on-metallic-surface-bIgpii04UIg?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(235, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(273, 46%, 48%)", "label": "LIFESTYLE", "seed": "787389163722"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-21", "word_count": 211, "reading_minutes": 1.1, "lead": "Apple had a busy 2026, with new chips, a folding phone and a new CEO. A Chinese tech site is now asking readers to rate the company's year.", "lead_zh": "苹果的2026年相当忙碌：新芯片、折叠手机，还有新CEO。国内一家科技媒体现在邀请读者给苹果这一年的表现打分。", "preview": "Apple moved quickly on hardware in 2026. It launched the MacBook Neo, a cheaper laptop with an A-series chip, so more people could buy a Mac", "preview_zh": "苹果在2026年硬件上动作很快。它推出了MacBook Neo，这是一款搭载A系列芯片的便宜笔记本，让更多人买得起Mac。M6芯片带来了更好的能效，新款MacBook Pro还首次加入了OLED触控屏。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 1016, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/104/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 74.225, "size_bytes": 446256, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 243, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/104/en_b1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 75.925, "size_bytes": 456480, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 243, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/104/en_b1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/104/en_b1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 81.425, "size_bytes": 489456, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 243, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/104/en_b1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/104/en_b1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 70.675, "size_bytes": 424944, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 243, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/104/en_b1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/104/en_b1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 75.175, "size_bytes": 452016, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 243, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/104/en_b1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@03411fdf/content/data/versions/1033.json", "paragraphs": ["Apple moved quickly on hardware in 2026. It launched the MacBook Neo, a cheaper laptop with an A-series chip, so more people could buy a Mac. The M6 chip brought better power efficiency, and the new MacBook Pro added an OLED touch screen for the first time.", "The iPhone 18 Pro gained a variable aperture, although the change was small. Apple's first folding phone, the iPhone Duo, drew the most attention, but it is expensive, heavy and still needs better app support. The HomeView smart home hub has yet to prove it can reach a wide market.", "Leadership also changed. After 15 years, Tim Cook handed the company to John Ternus. A smarter Siri with iOS 27 entered testing, but it is not fully ready, and its launch in China still lags behind the rest of the world. Regulators have slowed App Store growth, so people now ask what will drive Apple next.", "Since 2021, the site Shaoshupai has run an Apple rating event five times. From now until January 3, 2027, registered users can score Apple on nine areas. They will see other users' results at once, and 15 people who write good comments will win gifts.", "Users must have joined the site at least 30 days before taking part."], "paragraphs_zh": ["苹果在2026年硬件上动作很快。它推出了MacBook Neo，这是一款搭载A系列芯片的便宜笔记本，让更多人买得起Mac。M6芯片带来了更好的能效，新款MacBook Pro还首次加入了OLED触控屏。", "iPhone 18 Pro增加了可变光圈，不过变化不算大。苹果首款折叠手机iPhone Duo最受关注，但它价格贵、机身重，应用适配也还需改进。HomeView智能家居中枢能否打开大众市场，还有待观察。", "管理层也发生了变动。执掌公司15年后，Tim Cook把位置交给了John Ternus。随iOS 27而来的更聪明的Siri进入测试，但还不够成熟，在中国的上线也仍落后于全球。监管让App Store增长放缓，人们开始讨论苹果下一步靠什么增长。", "从2021年起，少数派已经办过五届苹果评分活动。从现在到2027年1月3日，注册用户可以就九个方面给苹果打分。他们能立刻看到其他用户的评分结果，写出精彩评论的15人还能获得礼品。", "参与者必须注册满30天。填写问卷即表示同意网站保存其用户名和答案，并在之后引用。问卷一旦提交，就不能修改或撤回。"], "body": "Apple moved quickly on hardware in 2026. It launched the MacBook Neo, a cheaper laptop with an A-series chip, so more people could buy a Mac. The M6 chip brought better power efficiency, and the new MacBook Pro added an OLED touch screen for the first time.\n\nThe iPhone 18 Pro gained a variable aperture, although the change was small. Apple's first folding phone, the iPhone Duo, drew the most attention, but it is expensive, heavy and still needs better app support. The HomeView smart home hub has yet to prove it can reach a wide market.\n\nLeadership also changed. After 15 years, Tim Cook handed the company to John Ternus. A smarter Siri with iOS 27 entered testing, but it is not fully ready, and its launch in China still lags behind the rest of the world. Regulators have slowed App Store growth, so people now ask what will drive Apple next.\n\nSince 2021, the site Shaoshupai has run an Apple rating event five times. From now until January 3, 2027, registered users can score Apple on nine areas. They will see other users' results at once, and 15 people who write good comments will win gifts.\n\nUsers must have joined the site at least 30 days before taking part.", "body_zh": "苹果在2026年硬件上动作很快。它推出了MacBook Neo，这是一款搭载A系列芯片的便宜笔记本，让更多人买得起Mac。M6芯片带来了更好的能效，新款MacBook Pro还首次加入了OLED触控屏。\n\niPhone 18 Pro增加了可变光圈，不过变化不算大。苹果首款折叠手机iPhone Duo最受关注，但它价格贵、机身重，应用适配也还需改进。HomeView智能家居中枢能否打开大众市场，还有待观察。\n\n管理层也发生了变动。执掌公司15年后，Tim Cook把位置交给了John Ternus。随iOS 27而来的更聪明的Siri进入测试，但还不够成熟，在中国的上线也仍落后于全球。监管让App Store增长放缓，人们开始讨论苹果下一步靠什么增长。\n\n从2021年起，少数派已经办过五届苹果评分活动。从现在到2027年1月3日，注册用户可以就九个方面给苹果打分。他们能立刻看到其他用户的评分结果，写出精彩评论的15人还能获得礼品。\n\n参与者必须注册满30天。填写问卷即表示同意网站保存其用户名和答案，并在之后引用。问卷一旦提交，就不能修改或撤回。", "text": "Apple moved quickly on hardware in 2026. It launched the MacBook Neo, a cheaper laptop with an A-series chip, so more people could buy a Mac. The M6 chip brought better power efficiency, and the new MacBook Pro added an OLED touch screen for the first time. The iPhone 18 Pro gained a variable aperture, although the change was small. Apple's first folding phone, the iPhone Duo, drew the most attention, but it is expensive, heavy and still needs better app support. The HomeView smart home hub has yet to prove it can reach a wide market. Leadership also changed. After 15 years, Tim Cook handed the company to John Ternus. A smarter Siri with iOS 27 entered testing, but it is not fully ready, and its launch in China still lags behind the rest of the world. Regulators have slowed App Store growth, so people now ask what will drive Apple next. Since 2021, the site Shaoshupai has run an Apple rating event five times. From now until January 3, 2027, registered users can score Apple on nine areas. They will see other users' results at once, and 15 people who write good comments will win gifts. Users must have joined the site at least 30 days before taking part.", "vocab": [{"word": "efficiency", "pos": "noun", "zh": "效率", "note": "常与 power 或 energy 搭配，指省电能力", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "aperture", "pos": "noun", "zh": "光圈", "note": "相机或手机镜头术语", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "folding", "pos": "adj", "zh": "折叠式的", "note": "folding phone 指折叠屏手机", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "hand over", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "移交、交接", "note": "hand sth over to sb，常指职位交接", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "lag behind", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "落后于", "note": "后接人或市场，表示进度慢", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "regulator", "pos": "noun", "zh": "监管机构", "note": "常用复数 regulators", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "survey", "pos": "noun", "zh": "问卷调查", "note": "fill in a survey 填问卷", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "submit", "pos": "verb", "zh": "提交", "note": "submit answers 提交答案", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "quote", "pos": "verb", "zh": "引用", "note": "常用于引用他人的话或内容", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "take part", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "参加", "note": "take part in sth，比 join 更强调参与活动", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-21T02:39:37.216062", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Apple", "s": 0.3, "e": 0.6, "sm": 300, "em": 600, "cs": 0, "ce": 5, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "moved", "s": 0.6, "e": 0.9, "sm": 600, "em": 899, "cs": 6, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "quickly", "s": 0.9, "e": 1.238, "sm": 900, "em": 1237, "cs": 12, "ce": 19, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "on", "s": 1.238, "e": 1.35, "sm": 1237, "em": 1350, "cs": 20, "ce": 22, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "hardware", "s": 1.35, "e": 1.85, "sm": 1350, "em": 1850, "cs": 23, "ce": 31, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "in", "s": 1.85, "e": 1.95, "sm": 1850, "em": 1949, "cs": 32, "ce": 34, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "2026", "s": 1.95, "e": 3.275, "sm": 1950, "em": 3275, "cs": 35, "ce": 39, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": ".", "s": 3.275, "e": 3.375, "sm": 3275, "em": 3375, "cs": 39, "ce": 40, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "It", "s": 3.375, "e": 3.525, "sm": 3375, "em": 3524, "cs": 41, "ce": 43, "si": 1}, {"i": 9, "w": "launched", "s": 3.525, "e": 3.837, "sm": 3525, "em": 3837, "